{"v":4,"catch":"驚險刺激的熱氣球之旅，不只是熱空氣！","desc":"《CRAZY BALLOON》是TAITO於1980年發行的動作遊戲。\n引導一隻搖擺的氣球穿過佈滿荊棘的迷宮，並嘗試避開移動的荊棘、移動迷宮等陷阱，到達目標。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-06-26","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7b73ae26d230729736b31b14bd7c6083264a3f1e7a5c476db88f268fcbcd98d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a7cd356dd604e19399744ded94e795d79e114be733a494da1de5edcc224591b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0e747cf840303af9b7e74384fab6707756f1fca8b3654f4d5a183373e0cda1a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/282afe7e220774971cceb032bb8af70fc986e3fa6c0571a99769ff7680349099.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/05a0f82a32646b247f99a4081e13a662ac8d6d032e0fff6f5e146ba14f9a6638.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79d53be46560e0e6ed9e35da354e3e45606affeb526a4f8510cddf8df66461ce.jpg"],"titleId":"0100159021a06000","dlc":[]}